WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,540
Platform transaction tax

2
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:03,580
My silver coins are not enough

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,740
Then come to my room for offline transactions

4
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:09,400
Remember not to be seen by others when you knock on the door. Thank you.

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,080
Thank you, classmate Chen An

6
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:17,560
can be seen

7
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:18,800
I grew up too fast

8
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,320
Will inevitably arouse greed

9
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,740
It would be troublesome if you have the talent of being able to deceive people by relying on your face.

10
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,340
That classmate Chen An

11
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,780
I only have nine silver coins now

12
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:27,300
Can you sell me eight units of lumber?

13
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,020
I'll pay you back the rest of the money as I owe you.

14
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:30,900
The wood is for upgrading the secondary door, right?

15
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:33,020
Aren't you short of gold coins? How did you make it up?

16
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,980
The mall has run out of wood

17
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,780
I found a roommate to live with

18
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:40,150
So it’s okay if you have gold coins?

19
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:41,950
I'll sell you eight units of wood for nine silver coins.

20
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:47,760
Classmate Chen An

21
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:49,360
I contacted other students

22
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,120
Either there is none or the price is too low

23
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:53,240
Chen An usually doesn't say a few words to me.

24
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,800
But he helped me twice in a row
